  "notes": "Production technical QA: 424 allowed characters; coverage 教3 合2 結2 如2 果2 解1; exact approved text/spokenText/displayLines preserved; canonical five games and all zero-based Han indexes verified. Ten mono 44100 Hz AAC files decoded, durations and loudness checked. Nine final processed audio transcripts matched approved Han text after simplified/traditional normalization; S02 and G02 suffix used general vocabulary context including 打結 to disambiguate the homophone 打劫. Earlier 1ms end timestamps caused complete audio regeneration, not fabricated timing. Final spans are 80-900ms. Only detected terminal silence was removed with at least 180ms after detected speech and 200ms after AI speech end, then final files were AI-aligned again. 教 generated once from standalone 教 with ㄐㄧㄠ instruction; independent transcription returned 蕉, a homophone with the intended first tone, not an exact orthographic match or human listening approval. S01 style-lock PASS, cast PASS; S02 style-lock PASS, cast PASS; S03 style-lock PASS, cast PASS; S04 style-lock PASS, cast PASS; S05 style-lock PASS, cast PASS. Exported WebP compared side by side with L058 full set, refined L115/L118/L119/L128 examples and family L154/L162/L163 anchors. S04 initial image had a premature pooled center coin pile; rejected, revised to exactly two side piles and empty center; rejected image not committed. Built-in imagegen used; existing references checked for reuse but do not show the approved teacher/cord/kitchen/pooling/missed-bus scenes. Browser QA tooling fallback: cua.getBrowser opening the local Vite app timed out after 30 seconds and reset its kernel. Phone playback/highlight/recording QA could not be performed; no subjective listening or completed browser QA is claimed. All non-browser technical gates are checked. Teacher subjective review remains post-merge. Full verify skipped: dependency-blocked; shared production JSON, planner and ledger unchanged. Release owns L415-L419 integration and final main validation. R051/R052 follows L420 and blocks L421, outside this package.",
